            "notes": "The key concept of this deck is to ramp up quickly with cards like Explore, Exploration, and Green Sun's Zenith to quickly get Nissa, Resurgent Animist out and start generating a massive amount of mana. Utilizing cards like Lotus Cobra and Utopia Sprawl to further accelerate mana production, the deck aims to overwhelm the opponent with large creatures like Primeval Titan, Ulamog, the Ceaseless Hunger, and Emrakul, the Promised End. The deck also includes utility lands like Maze of Ith and Ghost Quarter to disrupt the opponent's plans. With a focus on aggressive ramp and powerful threats, this deck aims to quickly establish board dominance and pressure the opponent into submission."
