            "notes": "This deck focuses on utilizing the aggro strategy with the duo commanders Ludevic, Necro-Alchemist and Yoshimaru, Ever Faithful. The main idea is to overwhelm the opponent with a fast and aggressive playstyle, supported by a variety of powerful creatures, spells, and equipment. The deck includes a mix of low-cost creatures for early pressure, removal spells like Lightning Bolt and Swords to Plowshares for control, and powerful equipment such as Embercleave and Skullclamp to boost the damage output of the creatures. The mana base is optimized for consistency and speed, with fetch lands like Arid Mesa and Flooded Strand to ensure access to the right colors of mana. Additionally, the inclusion of partner commanders allows for flexibility in decision-making and strategic options during the game."
